    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Bound Together</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Adora and Catra live together since they left their boarding school, but now Adora is moving states to attend her dream college and live with her current girlfriend. Catra, afraid of being alone, tries to manipulate Adora into staying with her, even if that means she has to bring up their troubled past and their stressful former affair. What they don't expect, though, is that the world is about to go into a long and traumatizing lockdown.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
